{"title":"Bear Meat for the Smokehouse","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">Wanted: ten cuts of bear meat to smoke for the watch&#39;s long patrols. Bears roam the woods north of Underleaf. Bring the meat to my bench. (Linnet Birch)</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/linnet-birch\">Linnet Birch</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"linnet-birch\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/bear-meat\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/a7b15f04819b91d44f5b.svg\" alt=\"\">Bear Meat</a> <b>×10</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/linnet-birch\">Linnet Birch</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Underleaf)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"linnet-birch\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Bring 10 bear meat to Linnet Birch in Underleaf <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/bear-meat\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/a7b15f04819b91d44f5b.svg\" alt=\"\">Bear Meat</a> <span class=\"muted\">at -36, 200</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-36|200|Bring 10 bear meat to Linnet Birch in Underleaf\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>130</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>4,500</td></tr><tr><td>Cooking XP</td><td>250</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Linnet Birch says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Linnet Birch:</b> Ten cuts. That&#39;ll smoke down to a month of trail rations for the watch.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Linnet Birch:</b> Your pay, and a word on keeping meat through a wet week.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"The watch eats well this month. Watch the board.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Bear Meat for the Smokehouse</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-bear-meat-for-the-smokehouse\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-bear-meat-for-the-smokehouse\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-bear-meat-for-the-smokehouse\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-bear-meat-for-the-smokehouse\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-bear-meat-for-the-smokehouse\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Linnet Birch says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-bear-meat-for-the-smokehouse\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}